---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, array_length(question_embedding), round(_score, 1) FROM vector_search(qs, 'second', question) order by _score desc LIMIT 4;"
---
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).answer, array_length(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).question_embedding), round(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question)._score,Int64(1))                                                                                                                                |
|               |   Sort: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question)._score DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |     Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).answer, array_length(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).question_embedding), round(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question)._score, Int32(1)) AS round(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question)._score,Int64(1)), vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question)._score |
|               |       TableScan: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question) projection=[id, answer, question_embedding, _score]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer, array_length(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).question_embedding)@2 as array_length(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).question_embedding), round(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question)._score,Int64(1))@3 as round(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question)._score,Int64(1))]                               |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@4 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer, array_length(question_embedding@2) as array_length(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).question_embedding), round(_score@3, 1) as round(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question)._score,Int64(1)), _score@3 as _score]                                                                                                     |
|               |       SortExec: TopK(fetch=1000), expr=[_score@3 DESC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |         ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer, question_embedding@2 as question_embedding, 1 - cosine_distance(CAST(query_vector() AS List(Field { data_type: Float32, nullable: true })), CAST(question_embedding@2 AS List(Field { data_type: Float32, nullable: true }))) as _score]                                                                                          |
|               |           SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |             BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |               DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[2]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
